{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01558","headline":"琴曲歌辞  幽居弄 · 顾况","name":"琴曲歌辞  幽居弄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苔衣生，花露滴，月入西林荡东壁。\n扣商占角两三声，洞户谿窗一冥寂。\n独去沧洲无四邻，身婴世网此何身？\n关情命曲寄惆怅，久别江南山里人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01558.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01558","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}